    "abilities": {
      "P": {
        "slot": "P",
        "id": "JhinPassive",
        "name": "Whisper",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Jhin's hand cannon, Whisper, is a precise instrument designed to deal superior damage. It fires at a fixed rate and carries only four shots. Jhin imbues the final bullet with dark magics to critically strike and deal bonus execute damage. Whenever Whisper crits, it inspires Jhin with a burst of Move Speed.",
        "bodyHtml": "Jhin's hand cannon has a fixed Attack Speed and can be fired 4 times before needing to be reloaded. The 4th shot always critically strikes, and deals an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(15% ~ 25%) missing health physical damage</span>.<br /><br />In addition:<span>Jhin gains <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">((4% ~ 36%) + ([[si:scalecrit]]35% Critical Strike Chance) + ([[si:scaleas]]30% bonus Attack Speed)) bonus Attack Damage</span><span>Jhin's critical strikes deal 25% less damage but grant him <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(14% + ([[si:scaleas]]44% bonus Attack Speed)) Move Speed</span> for 2 seconds.<br /><br />",
        "iconFile": "Jhin_P.png",
