      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "JhinQ",
        "name": "Dancing Grenade",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Jhin launches a magical cartridge at an enemy. It can hit up to four targets and gains damage each time it kills.",
        "bodyHtml": "Jhin launches a cartridge that deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(44/69/94/119/144 + ([[si:scalead]]44/51.5/59/66.5/74% Attack Damage) + ([[si:scaleap]]60% Ability Power)) physical damage</span> before bouncing to a nearby enemy that has not been hit yet.<br /><br />The cartridge can hit a maximum of 4 times. Enemies that die shortly after being hit increase the damage of subsequent hits by 35%.",
