      "E": {
        "slot": "E",
        "id": "JhinE",
        "name": "Captive Audience",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Jhin places an invisible lotus trap that blooms when walked over. It slows nearby enemies before dealing damage with an explosion of serrated petals. <br><br><font color='#FFFFFF'>Beauty in Death -</font> When Jhin kills an enemy champion, a lotus trap will bloom near their corpse.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>Passive:</span> Champions Jhin kills will create and detonate a Lotus Trap at their location.<br /><br /><span>Active:</span> Jhin places an invisible Lotus Trap for 3 minutes that creates a zone that <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> by 35% when stepped on by an enemy. After 2 seconds, the trap detonates, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(20/80/140/200/260 + ([[si:scalead]]120% Attack Damage) + ([[si:scaleap]]100% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br />This ability has 2 charges (24/21.5/19/16.5/14 second refresh).<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Lotus Trap hits deal 65% damage to minions, and enemies recently hit by another Lotus Trap.</span>",
